title: ai-tc
abstract: "AI Traffic Control: an open-source, local-first control plane for coding agents. Intercepts prompts, tool calls, responses and file reads, scans each against rule packs for secrets and regulated data, then enforces policy — monitor, warn, redact, block, or exception."
